<newsitem itemid="28654" id="root" date="1996-09-03" xml:lang="en">
<title>NETHERLANDS: NEDSCHROEF FIRST-HALF NET UP 15 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>NEDSCHROEF FIRST-HALF NET UP 15 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELMOND, Netherlands 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     7.45 vs   6.50</p>
<p>    Net profit			     5.6  vs   4.8</p>
<p>    Turnover			     168.7  vs 157.8</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     8.3  vs   6.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Metals group Koninklijke Nedschroef Holding NV said</p>
<p>in April it expected higher 1996 turnover but declined to give a</p>
<p>full-year profit forecast.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
